---
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
---

<!-- Challenge: Scaling & Cost -->
<div class="orange-gradient rounded-lg p-6">
  <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
    <Icon name="carbon:chart-area" class="w-6 h-6 text-orange-600" />
    Challenge: Scaling Infrastructure to 6,000 Engineers
  </h3>

  <div class="bg-white/80 rounded-lg p-5 mb-4 dark:bg-black/40 border border-orange-200 dark:border-orange-900/50">
    <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
      <Icon name="carbon:partnership" class="w-6 h-6 text-blue-600 flex-shrink-0 dark:text-blue-400" />
      <div>
        <h4 class="font-bold text-sm text-gray-900 mb-1 dark:text-white">The Leadership Challenge</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">This architecture work required infrastructure and tooling expertise outside my team's skillset. I had to <strong>break out of organizational silos</strong>, build new partnerships with Platform Infrastructure and DevOps teams, and orchestrate cross-functional work, all while keeping my frontend team focused on their core deliverables.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="bg-white/80 rounded-lg p-4 md:p-6 mb-4 dark:bg-black/40 border border-orange-200 dark:border-orange-900/50">
    <h4 class="font-bold text-sm mb-3 text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Technical & Cross-Functional Solutions</h4>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-2">
      <div class="green-gradient p-4 rounded-lg">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
          <Icon name="carbon:flash" class="w-5 h-5 text-green-600" />
          <h5 class="font-bold text-sm text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Performance Optimizations</h5>
        </div>
        <ul class="text-xs text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 space-y-1 ml-0 my-0 pl-6">
          <li class="pl-0 m-0"><strong>Incremental analysis:</strong> Only re-validate changed code</li>
          <li class="pl-0 m-0"><strong>Smart caching:</strong> Component metadata cached locally</li>
          <li class="pl-0 m-0"><strong>Diff-based validation:</strong> CI/CD only validates changes</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="blue-gradient p-4 rounded-lg">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
          <Icon name="carbon:piggy-bank" class="w-5 h-5 text-blue-600" />
          <h5 class="font-bold text-sm text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Cost Management</h5>
        </div>
        <ul class="text-xs text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 space-y-1 ml-0 my-0 pl-6">
          <li class="pl-0 m-0"><strong>Started:</strong> OpenAI API → $50K/month</li>
          <li class="pl-0 m-0"><strong>Migrated:</strong> Self-hosted Llama 2 70B on AWS Inferentia</li>
          <li class="pl-0 m-0"><strong>Result:</strong> $8K/month (86% reduction)</li>
          <li class="pl-0 m-0"><strong>Partnership:</strong> DevOps team provided infrastructure</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="purple-gradient p-4 rounded-lg">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
          <Icon name="carbon:user-multiple" class="w-5 h-5 text-primary-600" />
          <h5 class="font-bold text-sm text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Cross-Team Orchestration</h5>
        </div>
        <ul class="text-xs text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 space-y-1 ml-0 my-0 pl-6">
          <li class="pl-0 m-0"><strong>Platform Infra:</strong> Kubernetes scaling, load balancing, optimization</li>
          <li class="pl-0 m-0"><strong>DevOps:</strong> CI/CD pipeline infrastructure and integration</li>
          <li class="pl-0 m-0"><strong>Frontend Team:</strong> Maintained focus on core validation work</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="bg-white/80 rounded-lg p-5 mb-4 dark:bg-black/40 border border-orange-200 dark:border-orange-900/50">
    <h4 class="font-bold text-sm mb-3 text-gray-900 dark:text-white">How I Orchestrated Cross-Functional Work</h4>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-3">
      <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
        <Icon name="carbon:checkmark-filled" class="w-4 h-4 text-orange-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5 dark:text-orange-400" />
        <div>
          <div class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1 dark:text-white">Included Engineers in Business Decisions</div>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">CFO flagged $50K/month costs. I brought senior engineers to the meeting, and they proposed self-hosted solution (86% reduction)</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
        <Icon name="carbon:checkmark-filled" class="w-4 h-4 text-orange-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5 dark:text-orange-400" />
        <div>
          <div class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1 dark:text-white">Built Trust Through Partnership</div>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">Positioned frontend team as enablers, not blockers. Weekly syncs with Platform/DevOps, clear ownership boundaries</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
        <Icon name="carbon:checkmark-filled" class="w-4 h-4 text-orange-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5 dark:text-orange-400" />
        <div>
          <div class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1 dark:text-white">Kept Team Focused</div>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">Protected frontend team from infrastructure complexity while enabling partner teams with domain expertise</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-2">
    <div class="metric-box metric-box-green">
      <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-green-600 mb-1">&lt;90s</div>
      <p class="text-xs text-gray-700 font-semibold dark:text-white">CI/CD Runtime</p>
      <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-300">8min → 9.5min total</p>
    </div>
    <div class="metric-box metric-box-blue">
      <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-blue-600 mb-1">86%</div>
      <p class="text-xs text-gray-700 font-semibold dark:text-white">Cost Reduction</p>
      <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-300">$50K → $8K/month</p>
    </div>
    <div class="metric-box metric-box-purple">
      <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary-600 mb-1">3 teams</div>
      <p class="text-xs text-gray-700 font-semibold dark:text-white">Cross-Functional Partners</p>
      <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-300">Platform, DevOps, Frontend</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>